    "postShort": "New site. A river, seen from above, with a man drifting down it. That is the whole thing. jordanpitts.com",
    "postMedium": "jordanpitts.com went live tonight. It is an evolving site: every version is kept at a permanent archive URL and the front page is replaced on a schedule. v0 is a nine-second aerial film of a river with a man drifting down it. No words, one email button. https://jordanpitts.com",
    "postLong": "jordanpitts.com is live, and it is a river.\n\nThe idea: a website that gets replaced on a schedule, with every version kept forever at its own archive URL, so the site is less a page than a record of pages. v0 is where the record starts.\n\nv0 is a nine-second aerial film, generated, looping without a seam: a dark river winding through a green floodplain and a lone man drifting downstream on his back. No headline, no bio, no menu. One email button. The version, the date and a link to the archive sit in a small pill in the corner because the rules say they must.\n\nThe timeline lives at https://jordanpitts.com/timeline/ and there is an RSS feed. Nothing else to read this week. Go and look: https://jordanpitts.com",
